@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/message_reactions/
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceMessageReactionController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "Worker scope=message\nexact lease + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/message_reactions/
API -> DB: resolve public placement UUID;\ncheck active membership + generation
API -> DB: insert canonical reaction fact + immutable outbox event
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable reaction_snapshot(outbox_event_uuid)\n没有 coalescing
Worker -> Worker: claim (project_id, canonical_message_uuid)\nlease + fencing
Worker -> Projection: MESSAGE.reactions + reaction_users
Worker -> Events: message_reaction.created + message.updated\n原子在一个 DB transaction 投影
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
note over API,Worker
  Topic lock 没有使用. Lifecycle: retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper.
  Canonical-global audience 在 placements 已故意接受;
  placement UUID 仅用于 access check.
end note
@enduml
